{"id":321,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自主自律と文武両道で伸びる春日部共栄","feature_description":"春日部共栄中学校は、自主自律、明朗勤勉、協調奉仕を土台に、文武両道をめざす学校です。5つの力を育み、英語力の強化も前面に出しているため、学力と学校生活の両立を重視する姿勢が伝わります。中学の学びの方針が整理されています。 公式サイトの学校生活や行事の導線も整っており、比較用に必要な情報を確認しやすいです。入学後の姿も想像しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5991,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5992,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5993,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5994,"name":"男子ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5995,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5996,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5997,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5998,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5999,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6000,"name":"管弦楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6001,"name":"コンピュータ・囲碁将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6002,"name":"美術・コミックアート部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6003,"name":"茶華道・家庭科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.jp/jr/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6004,"name":"ESS","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.k-kyoei.ed.